<title>USA: NEI Webworld says CFO Fredriks resigns.</title>
<headline>NEI Webworld says CFO Fredriks resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>NEI Webworld Inc said Monday that Bruce Fredriks, its vice president for finance and administration and chief financial officer, has resigned effective July 3.</p>
<p>The commercial printing company said it has elected William Daniels to replace Fredriks.</p>
